      ['I can’t see the exact meeting point', 'You have not RSVP’d.', 'Tap RSVP — I’m going.'],
      ['No Edit or Cancel button', 'You are not the host, or the meetup is cancelled.', 'Only the host can edit or cancel a scheduled meetup.'],
